Package: cytoTerra
Title: Scalable Cytometry Gating Tools for Yale HPC Workflows
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Wenhuo", "Hu", email = "wenhuo.hu@yale.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for reproducible, scalable flow-cytometry analysis of large FCS data sets on high-performance computing systems. Provides FCS import and validation, channel inspection, automatic gate generation, storage of reproducible gate definitions, and support for interactive gating workflows in JupyterLab notebooks using the IRkernel.
